    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascent of Eternity is the first game being developed by Seventh Eye Studio in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A primordial trial exists.<br>Reborn in the punctum of eternity, a path to immortality has been presented to you.<br>Through the 7 eternal dimensions ancient powers seek to annihilate you. In eternity many challenges exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven Eternal Dimensions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punctum, Epirynth, Tertiamsion, Tesseration, Dodeciahysion, Hexerasion, and Hepternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through randomized  dimensional worlds of increasing dimensional complexity to conquer Eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Elemental Paths:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first 7 elemental paths, Fire, Ice, Electric, Light, Dark, Metal, and Life are the starting point of mastery. Each path has a unique set of 7 magical abilities with increasing strength. You must progress through the paths by defeating enemies in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and Deities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarmed from all sides. stepping into dimensions will summon a horde of opposition. Powerful foes and forces seek to deny your ascent. Defeat or be defeated by endless swarms of enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to immortality is not a simple one. Embrace the allure of magical power to control the elements and dimensions. Massively action packed magical combat chaos awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ascent of Eternity is the first game being developed by Seventh Eye Studio in Unreal Engine 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A primordial trial exists.<br>Reborn in the punctum of eternity, a path to immortality has been presented to you.<br>Through the 7 eternal dimensions ancient powers seek to annihilate you. In eternity many challenges exist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven Eternal Dimensions:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punctum, Epirynth, Tertiamsion, Tesseration, Dodeciahysion, Hexerasion, and Hepternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse through randomized  dimensional worlds of increasing dimensional complexity to conquer Eternity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >22 Elemental Paths:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The first 7 elemental paths, Fire, Ice, Electric, Light, Dark, Metal, and Life are the starting point of mastery. Each path has a unique set of 7 magical abilities with increasing strength. You must progress through the paths by defeating enemies in combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and Deities:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swarmed from all sides. stepping into dimensions will summon a horde of opposition. Powerful foes and forces seek to deny your ascent. Defeat or be defeated by endless swarms of enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path to immortality is not a simple one. Embrace the allure of magical power to control the elements and dimensions. Massively action packed magical combat chaos awaits you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>",
    "short_description": "ASCENT OF ETERNITY\u2122 is an action-rpg rogue-like magical horde-slaying third person coop game.\u00a0Fire, Ice, Electric, Light, Dark, Metal, and Life. The 7 elements call for mastery. Master the elements and ascend through eternity!",
